          "number": 4,
          "letter": "D",
          "english": "It's a timely quest. The food sector is already responsible for nearly a third of global greenhouse gas emissions. By 2050 it estimates the world must produce 50% more food to feed the projected global population of 10 billion. Meeting this demand without contributing to climate change calls for urgent solutions.",
          "chinese": "这项探索来得正是时候。目前，粮食部门造成的温室气体排放量已经接近全球总排放量的三分之一。据估计，到2050年，为了养活预计达到100亿的全球人口，世界必须多生产50%的食物。在不助长气候变化的情况下满足这一需求，需要紧迫的解决方案。",
